#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""riview — Reloading Image Viewer.

Watches a directory (or a single image file, R21) and always displays the
newest image in it. When a newer image appears, or the displayed file is
updated, the view updates automatically.

Specification & design: RIVIEW-SW-SPEC-AND-DESIGN.md (spec §§1–11,
design §§12–13), rev 1.0.

Single file, no pip dependencies: Python 3.10+ with system PyGObject
(GTK 4 + libadwaita) for GUI mode. `--print` and the desktop flags need no
display.
"""

